    "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Důležité: Při zaznamenávání stiskněte POUZE aktivační klávesu (např. tabulátor, pokud chcete Command + Tab). Během zaznamenávání nemačkejte iniciační klávesu."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vigtigt: Tryk under optagelse KUN på udløsertasten (f.eks. tryk blot på Fane, hvis kommando + Fane ønskes). Tryk ikke på initialiseringstasten under optagelse."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wichtig: Bei der Aufnahme nur die Trigger-Taste drücken (z.B. drücken Sie einfach Tab, wenn Sie Command + Tab möchten). Drücken Sie nicht die Initialisierungstaste während der Aufnahme."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Importante: Al grabar, presione SÓLO la tecla desencadenante (p.ej. Pulse Tab si desea comando + tab). No pulse la tecla de inicialización durante la grabación."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Important : Lors de l’enregistrement, appuyez SEULEMENT sur la touche de déclenchement (par ex. appuyez simplement sur Tab si vous souhaitez Commande + Tab). N’appuyez pas sur la touche d’initialisation pendant l’enregistrement."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "חשוב: בעת הקלטה, לחץ רק על מקש ההפעלה (למשל רק לחץ על Tab אם אתה רוצה Command + Tab). אל תלחץ על מקש האתחול במהלך ההקלטה."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fontos: A rögzítés közben csak a trigger billentyűt nyomd meg (például csak a Tabot, ha a Command + Tab kombinációt szeretnéd).\nA rögzítés közben ne nyomd meg az inicializáló billentyűt."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Attenzione: premi solo il tasto principale (es. 'tab'), NON il tasto base (es. 'cmd').\nSe la combinazione prevista è cmd+tab, premi solo 'tab'."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重要: 録画中はトリガーキーだけを押してください（たとえばCommand+Tabを設定したい場合はTabだけを押す）。録画中に初期化キーは押さないでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "중요: 녹화할 때는 트리거 키만 누르세요(예: 명령 + Tab을 원할 경우 Tab만 누르세요). 녹화 중에는 초기화 키를 누르지 마세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Belangrijk: Druk tijdens het vastleggen ALLEEN op de activeringstoets (druk bijvoorbeeld alleen op Tab als je Command+Tab wilt gebruiken). Druk tijdens het vastleggen NIET op de initialisatietoets."
          }
        },
        "no" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Importante: Ao gravar aperte APENAS o botão (somente pressione Tab se quiser ativar o comando + Tab) Não aperte o botão de inicialização durante a gravação"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Важно: При записи нажмите ТОЛЬКО клавишу триггера (напр. Просто нажмите Tab, если вы хотите использовать команду + Tab). Не нажимайте клавишу инициализации во время записи."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: When recording, press ONLY the trigger key (e.g. just press Tab if you want command + Tab). Do not press the initialization key during recording."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ÖNEMLİ: Kayıt sırasında yalnızca tetikleyici tuşuna basın (örneğin, komut + sekmesi istiyorsanız sekmeye basın). Kayıt sırasında başlatma tuşuna basmayın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Важливо: Під час запису натискайте ТІЛЬКИ клавішу-тригер (наприклад, просто натисніть Tab, якщо хочете Command + Tab). Не натискайте клавішу ініціалізації під час запису."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quan trọng: Khi ghi phím, chỉ nhấn phím kích hoạt (ví dụ: chỉ nhấn Tab nếu bạn muốn Command + Tab). Không nhấn phím khởi tạo trong lúc ghi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重要提示：录制时仅按触发键（例如，要使用“Command + Tab”，只需按“Tab”键）。录制过程中不要按初始化键。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重要：記錄按鍵時只按下最終鍵（例如：若要使用Command + Tab，請只按下 Tab 鍵）。記錄期間請勿按下變更鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
