            "value" : "Scroll up on a focused window title bar to maximize it, scroll down to center it using the configured window size, and scroll left or right to switch desktop spaces. Repeat the same up/down scroll within the configured restore time to restore the previous window size."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Прокрутите заголовок выделенного окна вверх, чтобы развернуть его, прокрутите вниз, чтобы отцентрировать его, используя заданный размер окна, и прокрутите влево или вправо, чтобы переключить рабочие пространства. Повторите ту же прокрутку вверх/вниз в течение заданного времени восстановления, чтобы восстановить предыдущий размер окна."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scroll up on a focused window title bar to maximize it, scroll down to center it using the configured window size, and scroll left or right to switch desktop spaces. Repeat the same up/down scroll within the configured restore time to restore the previous window size."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scroll up on a focused window title bar to maximize it, scroll down to center it using the configured window size, and scroll left or right to switch desktop spaces. Repeat the same up/down scroll within the configured restore time to restore the previous window size."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Odaklanmış bir pencerenin başlık çubuğunda yukarı kaydırarak pencereyi tam ekrana getirin, aşağı kaydırarak pencereyi ayarlanan boyuta göre ortalayın ve sola veya sağa kaydırarak masaüstü alanları arasında geçiş yapın. Önceki pencere boyutuna geri dönmek için, ayarlanan geri yükleme süresi içinde aynı yukarı/aşağı kaydırma hareketini tekrarlayın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scroll up on a focused window title bar to maximize it, scroll down to center it using the configured window size, and scroll left or right to switch desktop spaces. Repeat the same up/down scroll within the configured restore time to restore the previous window size."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuộn lên thanh tiêu đề cửa sổ để phóng to; cuộn xuống để căn giữa; cuộn trái/phải để chuyển desktop. Lặp lại trong thời gian cài đặt để khôi phục kích thước trước."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聚焦的窗口标题栏上向上滚动以使其最大化，使用配置的窗口大小向下滚动以使其居中，并向左或向右滚动以切换桌面空间。在配置的恢复时间内重复相同的上下滚动以恢复以前的窗口大小。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在最前方視窗的標題列向上捲動來最大化；向下捲動來置中為指定大小；向左／右捲動來切換桌面空間。在指定的復原時間內重複操作可復原為先前的狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
