    "When you click the button below, DockDoor will restart and move to the menu bar to run in the background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When you click the button below, DockDoor will restart and move to the menu bar to run in the background."
